	    "- `([a-zA-Z_]\w*)`: Function name" + Char(10) +
	    "- `\s*\((.*?)\)`: Function arguments" + Char(10) +
	    "- `$`: End of line" + Char(10) + Char(10) +

	    "- Matches: `Calculate()`, `Add(x, y)`" + Char(10) +
	    "- Non-matches: `Call()`, `1Function()`"
