	    "- `Class\s+`: Class keyword" + Char(10) +
	    "- `([a-zA-Z_]\w*)`: Class name" + Char(10) +
	    "- `$`: End of line" + Char(10) + Char(10) +

	    "- Matches: `Public Class Customer`, `Private Class Helper`" + Char(10) +
