	    "- `^`: Start of line" + Char(10) +
	    "- `(?:Public\s+|Private\s+|Protected\s+)?`: Optional scope" + Char(10) +
	    "- `Property\s+`: Property keyword" + Char(10) +
	    "- `(?:Get|Let|Set)`: Property type" + Char(10) +
