	    "- `^`: Start of line" + Char(10) +
	    "- `(?:Try|Catch|Finally)`: Error handling keywords" + Char(10) +
	    "- `\s*`: Optional whitespace" + Char(10) +
	    "- `$`: End of line" + Char(10) + Char(10) +

	    "- Matches: `Try`, `Catch`, `Finally`" + Char(10) +
	    "- Non-matches: `Try Catch`, `Catch Error`"
